        "valueString": "No scales available; patient thinks she has had central weight gain over the last 2 years."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Other reported symptoms deferred from this visit"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Right shoulder pain when hanging washing; intermittent toe tingling when sitting in an unusual position; altered taste after some foods; dry eyes when using a computer. Patient's husband thinks a mole on her back may be darker."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Preventive screening history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Unsure when blood pressure, lipids, and glucose were last checked. Thinks cervical screening was more than 5 years ago. Mammogram was a few years ago, timing uncertain. Unsure whether she has ever completed a bowel cancer screening kit."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
